@rootUrl = http://localhost:8000

#API List

### Check Server status
GET {{rootUrl}}

## Authentication API

### Check Server status
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fName": "Nischal",
    "lName": "Bhatta",
    "email": "b33@a.com",
    "phone": "41221345",
    "password": "12345"
}

### POST to activate user
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/activate-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "sessionId":"6ae1b2da4a7990b454b19e9b",
   "t":"256675ad-f212-43cc-9842-d5d689e88760"
}
### Login User
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "1@7.com",
   "password": "Asdf1@"
}
### Request password reset OTP
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "1@7.com"
}
### Reset password with OTP
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "1@7.com",
   "otp": "123456",
   "password": "Asdf1@new",
   "confirmPassword": "Asdf1@new"
}
### Get User Profile
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6IjFANy5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTQ0NTUxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc5NzA0NzE2Nn0.PIarMZW_9D6xr8KkluViKSh0V9S3WrvbaX9fMHkDubk
### renew JWT
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/renew-jwt
Authorization: bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6IjFANy5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTQ0NTUxNjYsImV4cCI6MTc5NzA0NzE2Nn0.PIarMZW_9D6xr8KkluViKSh0V9S3WrvbaX9fMHkDubk